        "description_WA46KB": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "description_text": "<p>We specialize in manufacturing high-performance machinery parts used in the field every day by equipment operators. Our team works with contractors, developers, and OEMs to support the production of:</p><ul><li>Skid Steer Loaders</li><li>Compact Track Loaders</li><li>Backhoe Loaders</li><li>Motor Graders</li><li>Drilling Rigs</li><li>And More</li></ul><p>As experienced heavy equipment manufacturers, we’re able to support new product development efforts or improve the function and durability of existing machines.</p>"
